OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 102, with dementia died after
OL,4,Abeing pushed in pub, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 102-year-old man with dementia who
OL,7,Fwas allegedly pushed at a Cwmbran pub
OL,8,Fdied nearly two weeks later, an inquest
OL,9,Fhas heard.
OL,11,FPhilip Ormerod, from Cwmbran, Torfaen,
OL,12,Fwas taken to hospital in a critical
OL,13,Fcondition following an incident at the
OL,14,FCrows Nest pub in the town on 1 August.
OL,16,FHe is understood to have been visiting
OL,17,Fthe pub for a drink when he went on to
OL,18,Fa stage in the venue to complain about
OL,19,Fthe volume of the music.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
