OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 102, with dementia died after
OL,4,Abeing pushed in pub, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 56-year-old man from Llanelli,
OL,7,FCarmarthenshire, was arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of inflicting grievous bodily
OL,9,Fharm, and remains on bail under
OL,10,Finvestigation.
